- bypass, disable or tamper with licence checks or Pro restrictions;
- remove or change copyright, trademark or legal notices.

4. Ownership
The Software is licensed, not sold. All rights, in particular copyright, in the
Software, its code, design, texts and icons remain with the author.

5. Earlier versions
Versions up to and including 3.7.5 were published under the MIT License. For
copies of those versions obtained at that time, the MIT License continues to
